{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__4_.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/16d258c8b914c18a69ee7c8d6b79fdba.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>\u00a0you've returned from the<strong> horrors of war</strong> to find your wife and daughter  missing. Years later, you're still searching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/e4c24ad16ee76b3a190be0ac8b25998e.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>\u00a0c<strong>hasing the unexplained</strong>. With every story, you hold on to the hope that one day, something will lead you back to them.   <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/13d44802849336b358d0db45be1c2c07.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>\u00a0takes you to '<strong>Breken House</strong>' in  England's snowy West Country. It feels familiar in a way that unsettles you, like you\u2019re finally close\u2026 or about to lose them all over again.     <br>      <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/3f058b2c1394d097557d0027b72a8886.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>\u00a0detective Gwen Porter\u2019s case begins with a missing patient and a dead orderly, leading her into a <strong>tangled mystery that connects lives, past and present.</strong>    <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-optimize__4_.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/8533e2a5f6ca463a531c8e295fe5456b.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>as you sort through <strong>shards of memory's</strong> and scraps of <strong>evidence</strong>. What John forgot may be the key to solving Gwen\u2019s case.      <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-optimize__5_.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/c098001b8920728465a3725ff8a7ae79.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>you're haunted by\u00a0memories of<strong> D-Day, 1944,\u00a0</strong>orders lost in smoke, and the friends who didn\u2019t make it home. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.poster.avif?t=1753135858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.webm?t=1753135858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/7abb3cf31fee7097d17106eb499fa1cf.mp4?t=1753135858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/4bb3fbfa7270579b002bd470eb4722d3.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div><br>With <u><strong>8 unique endings</strong></u><strong>\u00a0-</strong>\u00a0Choose your words carefully  some decisions cannot be undone. <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/cd4cff7f116e6303316efe1246172639.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div><br>A fully voiced narrative experience, delivered by a professional cast.  <br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/45335f87295315f1c8337741119f5832.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div><br>John &amp; Gwen's stories weave together in the past and present  as does the <strong>consequences</strong> of <span class=\"bb_strike\">their</span>\u00a0your decisions.  <br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/0c97f4e3235c75d9aa84ba83a40ae4ce.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div><br>Beautifully produced dark cello soundtrack supporting the game\u2019s themes of loss and memory, shifting between tension and sorrow, and rising to fear and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/560ff3729582378969260b0de39e6333.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div><br>Hollow Mire is inspired by <strong>themes of mid-20th century, England,</strong>\u00a0at a time when the country was recovering from war. A time before computers, before cell phones. Food rationing was still in effect and many families were coming to terms with the idea that many of the soldiers who went to Europe were never coming home.\u00a0 \u00a0<strong> </strong>  <br>  <br><strong>In 1952 a large blizzard swept across England</strong>, particularly impacting the West Country where Hollow Mire is set. The dark, snowy Devonshire Countryside is a truly beautiful and equally atmospheric place. It's quiet, lonely, dark and remote.     <br>  <br> You'll return to Normandy on <strong>June 6th 1944 (D-Day),</strong> seen as the turning point of the second World War. Part of the 9th Parachute Battalion, dropping behind enemy lines ahead of the main landings, and later visiting the camps.\u00a0     <br>  <br>Players should expect Hollow Mire to visit <strong>mature themes</strong> in some of the <strong>most difficult times in human history</strong>.\u00a0  <br>  <br>All environments are hand-painted with a focus on realism, a blend of Victorian and Edwardian architecture.   <br>  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357160?t=1753135858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753135858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/b74e378e5a8beefa027e6d68a7c21a7647ea0be2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753135858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/b74e378e5a8beefa027e6d68a7c21a7647ea0be2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753135858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Disclaimer\r\n\r\nThis game contains content that may be disturbing, unsettling, or triggering to some individuals. It explores sensitive themes, including but not limited to:\r\n\r\nConcentration Camps: The game presents a depiction of a concentration camp and related historical events. These are portrayed in a respectful and sensitive manner to foster understanding of their historical impact.\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: The game features horror themes that may cause discomfort or fear. Player discretion is advised.\r\n\r\nPsychosis, PTSD, and Mental Health Conditions: The narrative includes themes of psychosis, PTSD, and other mental health struggles. These elements are handled with care, but may be distressing for those who have personal experience with these conditions.\r\n\r\nMedical Treatments: The game involves depictions of medical treatments, including electroshock therapy, in a historical context. These depictions are intended for storytelling purposes and may be unsettling.\r\n\r\nViolence and Death: The game includes graphic violence and depictions of death, which may be upsetting to some players.\r\n\r\nOther Mature Themes: The game features other mature and potentially disturbing themes. Player discretion is strongly advised before proceeding.\r\n\r\nBy continuing to play, you acknowledge that you are aware of these themes and consent to engaging with this content. If you are sensitive to any of the aforementioned topics, or if you are under the age of 18, we recommend exercising caution or seeking alternative content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__4_.gif?t=1753135858\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357160/extras/16d258c8b914c18a69ee7c8d6b79fdba.avif?t=1753135858\" /></div>\u00a0you've returned from the<strong> horrors of war</strong> to find your wife and daughter  missing. Years later, you're still searching.</p><p cla